TEXT -1800 -80 Left 2 !*=========================================================\n* Delay Calculation\n*=========================================================\n \n* Output a0\n.meas time1 FIND time WHEN V(a0)=1 RISE=1\n.meas time2 FIND time WHEN V(b0)=1 FALL=1\n.meas TPHL PARAM time2-time1\n \n* Output a1\n.meas time3 FIND time WHEN V(a1)=1 FALL=1\n.meas time4 FIND time WHEN V(b1)=1 RISE=1\n.meas TPLH PARAM time4-time3\n \n* Average Propagation Delay\n.meas delay PARAM (TPHL+TPLH)/2\n \n\n*=========================================================\n* Fall Time\n*=========================================================\n \n.meas timea FIND time WHEN V(a0)=1 RISE=1\n.meas timeb FIND time WHEN V(b0)=1 FALL=1\n.meas tfall PARAM timeb-timea\n \n\n*=========================================================\n* Rise Time\n*=========================================================\n \n.meas timec FIND time WHEN V(a1)=1 FALL=1\n.meas timed FIND time WHEN V(b1)=1 RISE=1\n.meas trise PARAM timed-timec
